1169
01:01:22.390 --> 01:01:23.530
You are not the last either.

1170
01:01:25.770 --> 01:01:27.050
But you're my third.

1171
01:01:28.950 --> 01:01:30.270
No promotions

1172
01:01:31.990 --> 01:01:33.520
or demotions.

1173
01:01:36.970 --> 01:01:38.860
You will stay as my third.

1174
01:01:41.520 --> 01:01:43.660
And my third means...

1175
01:01:49.660 --> 01:01:51.070
my beloved.

1176
01:02:00.460 --> 01:02:02.550
And I love you the most, too.

1177
01:02:07.660 --> 01:02:11.800
♫I'll simply be right here, always within reach♫

1178
01:02:11.800 --> 01:02:16.310
♫Like a gentle breeze bringing you peace♫

1179
01:02:16.310 --> 01:02:23.620
♫I'll stay right here by your side, always♫

1180
01:02:57.370 --> 01:02:59.990
